// Format: Hexadecimal Machine Code
00500113  // ADDI x2, x0, 5   (Loads 5 into x2)
002101b3  // ADD  x3, x2, x2  (x3 = x2 + x2 = 5 + 5 = 10) -> Immediate Hazard on x2!
003180b3  // SUB  x1, x3, x3  (x1 = x3 - x3 = 10 - 10 = 0) -> Immediate Hazard on x3!
00208133  // ADD  x2, x1, x2  (x2 = x1 + x2 = 0 + 5 = 5)   -> Immediate Hazard on x1!